segment.source:
::He's caught off guard by your statement.::

You... you found them? That... that was fast...

Outstanding work, Corporal. Free Drones, you say... To be frank, it's no surprise. I already had suspicions it was them skittering around... I just needed proof. ::His eyes shift to the right while he continues.:: So, they suspect something is happening here... We need to mobilize. I'll request more troops from Fort Apogee... hmmm...&lt;end&gt;

